| `scripts/exit_codes.py` | Holds the closed `ExitCode` list and the one place a process ends: `report` writes the three-part failure line, `passthrough` marks a wrapped tool's status, `finish` exits, and `fail` is `finish` over `report`. | imported by its bare name | — | Not a logger, and it reads no config. Not the gate on its callers: `tests/integration/test_exit_gate.py` is. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
